      "id": 484361,
      "username": "rk_root",
      "name": "Ramakrishnan Nataraj",
      "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:13:26.789Z",
      "cooked": "<p><strong>Payroll Entry = Accounting for salary expense</strong><br>\n<strong>Bank Payment = Clearing the payable (linked through the Journal Entry field)</strong></p>\n<p>If you’re managing salary payments through the <strong>“Generate Bank File”</strong> option, these fields help record which account the file belongs to and simplify reconciliation later.</p>",
