      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:57:15.993Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Once you set up the account and bank account in Payroll Entry, you’ll see the “Make Bank Entry” button after submitting Salary Slips.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/9/09d70cc2cedf085aa73a90c81f6de3240fa75361.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/09d70cc2cedf085aa73a90c81f6de3240fa75361\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-18 at 1.55.30 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/9/09d70cc2cedf085aa73a90c81f6de3240fa75361_2_690x334.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-18 at 1.55.30 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"1p32rtTXIPkF7TtpgV989t4GRRD\" width=\"690\" height=\"334\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/9/09d70cc2cedf085aa73a90c81f6de3240fa75361_2_690x334.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/9/09d70cc2cedf085aa73a90c81f6de3240fa75361_2_1035x501.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/9/09d70cc2cedf085aa73a90c81f6de3240fa75361_2_1380x668.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-10-18 at 1.55.30 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1430×694 66.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
